      ]
     },
     "then": [
      {
       "say": "lb-farmer",
       "text": "\"That cart at Hob's Bend. That was you? With the children? Well. Sit down, then. There's bread.\""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lb-boy",
   "map": "town-longbarrow",
   "x": 4,
   "y": 9,
   "look": "kid",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "lb-boy",
     "text": "\"If you lie on the barrow at night you can hear it breathing. Ansel's brother says so. I'm Ansel.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cw-spinner",
   "map": "town-cinderwick",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "vil2",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A spinner on her break, sitting on the edge of a stall. \"Fourteen hours on the frames. Fifteen, if the foreman's wearing. You get so you can't feel your fingers, then you get so you can't feel anything. That's what the tins are for.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cw-boy",
   "map": "town-cinderwick",
   "x": 15,
   "y": 5,
   "look": "kid",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A boy with a sack of bobbins. \"The drain under the wall? Everybody knows about the drain. Nobody goes down it. It comes out at the Houses.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cw-lock",
   "map": "town-cinderwick",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 8,
   "look": "vil6",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A lock-keeper leaning on his pole. \"Smoke and canals, that's Cinderwick. The mills drink the river and the Guild drinks the mills.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ls-bargee",
   "map": "town-lockside",
   "x": 5,
   "y": 7,
   "look": "vil4",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A bargee mending a rope. \"Corvel's hatchery is up the cut. You can hear the boilers knocking at night if the wind's right. Nobody round here goes near it.\""
    },
    {
     "if": {
      "stage": [
       "ad6b",
       "ad7",
       "ad8",
       "ad9",
       "ad10",
       "ae1",
       "ae2",
       "ae3",
       "ae4",
       "ad11",
       "ad12",
       "ad13",
       "ad14",
       "ad15",
       "ad16",
       "ad16l",
       "ad17",
       "ad18",
       "ad19",
       "ad19b",
       "ad20"
      ]
     },
     "then": [
      {
       "say": "",
       "text": "A bargee mending a rope. \"Ninety-one of them, walking up the towpath in the dark, holding hands. My wife cried. I didn't see anything, mind. I was asleep.\""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ls-woman",
   "map": "town-lockside",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 6,
   "look": "vil5",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A woman hanging washing between two boats. \"My sister's girl went into Corvel's at seven. She'll come out at twenty, if she comes out. That's the indenture.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ls-dog",
   "map": "town-lockside",
   "x": 19,
   "y": 9,
   "look": "reedcat",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A barge reedcat, asleep on a coil of rope in the sun. It doesn't care who you are."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cg-chandler",
   "map": "town-candle-galleries",
   "x": 5,
   "y": 6,
   "look": "vil7",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "An old chandler dipping wicks. \"The galleries were cut for tallow, back when the mills ran on candles. Now the Sisters keep them lit, and nobody asks what for.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cg-novice",
   "map": "town-candle-galleries",
   "x": 12,
   "y": 2,
   "look": "vil3",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A young woman in a grey hood, trimming a lamp in a niche. She smiles at you, and doesn't say anything, and goes on to the next lamp."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cg-girl",
   "map": "town-candle-galleries",
   "x": 15,
   "y": 6,
   "look": "kid2",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A girl counting candles into a basket. \"Forty-one, forty-two. If I lose count I have to start again. I never lose count.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ld-keeper",
   "map": "town-lockkeepers-deep",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 7,
   "look": "vil4",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "The keeper of the deep lock, a big slow man. \"Deepest lock in Ostrel. Thirty feet of water. Takes an hour to fill. I've had a lot of hours to think.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ld-wife",
   "map": "town-lockkeepers-deep",
   "x": 15,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "vil2",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "His wife, gutting fish. \"He thinks too much. Here. Take a fish. You look like you've walked a long way.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ld-boy",
   "map": "town-lockkeepers-deep",
   "x": 12,
   "y": 8,
   "look": "kid3",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A boy fishing off the lock gate with a bent nail. He hasn't caught anything. He doesn't mind."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cf-puddler",
   "map": "town-cinderwick--foundry",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 4,
   "look": "vil4",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A puddler with a long iron bar, stirring something white-hot through a hatch. He doesn't look up. \"Warden steel. They take every bar we make and pay for half. The other half's what they call protection.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cf-foreman",
   "map": "town-cinderwick--foundry",
   "x": 6,
   "y": 6,
   "look": "vil6",
   "when": {
    "stagePrefix": "a"
   },
   "talk": [
    {
     "say": "",
     "text": "A foreman with a slate and a cough. \"Sixty hands on the day shift, forty at night. Forty-one, if you count the boy who sweeps the slag. I don't. He's not on the books.\""
    },
    {
     "if": {
      "stage": [
       "ad1",
       "ad2",
       "ad3",
